              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abo basiinga chingubo chabwe nio bafukiililwe khulia kamatuunda khu murongooro kwe bulamu, ne khubira bengile mu lukoba khubirira mu bilibwa babiitwa chikhabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne enje we lukoba chimbwa chiliyo nende abo bakhola bufumu, be sifwaabi, babeeri, abo basaaya bifwaani nende abo baali babeeyi mu makhuwa ne mu bikholwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
